Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.74,0:00:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mighty Little Defenders 11 – New Wild Cosmos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}The Last Stand
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Episode 56
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.38,0:12:36.94,end,,0,0,0,,To be continued
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.19,0:00:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks so quiet here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.72,0:00:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m not afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.87,0:00:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let go of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.15,0:00:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,We’re all on the same side; no need to be so formal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.16,0:00:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s not snow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.08,0:00:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.52,0:00:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The Absorption Device might be nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.52,0:00:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.36,0:00:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.92,0:01:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you guys hear a sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.44,0:01:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Sparky
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.92,0:01:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Xi Huahua, help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.76,0:01:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Xi’er
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.16,0:01:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,—Elder —Big Sister
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.56,0:01:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.80,0:01:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.93,0:01:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.41,0:01:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy, hang in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.37,0:01:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, without the device…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.89,0:01:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,it would be impossible for them to appear here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.18,0:01:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s a trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.07,0:01:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t go over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.51,0:01:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The sound is coming from…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.66,0:01:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.00,0:02:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It was all a fake-out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.39,0:02:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We let our guard down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.59,0:02:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,He wanted to separate us to weaken our combat strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.24,0:02:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to be extremely cautious.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.28,0:02:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.56,0:02:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at me, I’m all filthy now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.11,0:02:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you see…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.27,0:02:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,it was an emergency, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.48,0:02:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why did you drag me to such a dirty place?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.54,0:02:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s been so long; I wonder how Weslie and the others are doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.06,0:02:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry; given their years of adventure experience,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.75,0:02:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,they’ll definitely be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.18,0:02:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s been so long; why hasn’t Wolffy changed back yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.70,0:02:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry. Based on my years of experience with inventions,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.98,0:02:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,he’ll certainly restore.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.52,0:02:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m still a bit worried, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.19,0:02:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s great!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.91,0:02:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy can fight side-by-side with Brother Weslie and the others again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.43,0:03:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But once Dad is back to normal,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.72,0:03:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,will he still be able to use that gauntlet?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.19,0:03:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m afraid not.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.11,0:03:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry, I have a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.82,0:03:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Mommy, I’m coming too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.43,0:03:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn’t expect the four of you to have some skill when working together.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.23,0:03:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,But that’s as far as it—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.66,0:03:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You have too many openings.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.62,0:03:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Sister Xi’er is so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.42,0:03:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t let your guard down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.82,0:03:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.01,0:03:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.30,0:03:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you looking?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.57,0:03:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.74,0:04:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to be careful; he’s everywhere here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.50,0:04:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You can’t possibly defeat me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.45,0:04:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,We just need to find your core and destroy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.94,0:04:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Every move you make here
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.62,0:04:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,is crystal clear to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.89,0:04:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I really want to see
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.93,0:04:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,how exactly you plan to realize your grand ambitions.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.09,0:04:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s great that you’ve all come to your senses.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.65,0:04:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let’s go stop Blue right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.38,0:04:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,To think you’d betray me for the outsiders…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.73,0:04:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You were the one who betrayed us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.01,0:04:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Betrayed you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.05,0:04:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,If it weren’t for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.73,0:04:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,you’d still be living in that world on the verge of vanishing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.50,0:05:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I was the one who made your dreams come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.46,0:05:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though the process differed slightly,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.46,0:05:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,we’ve achieved the outcome we originally agreed upon, haven’t we?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.14,0:05:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn’t the outcome we wanted at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.14,0:05:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue, stop this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.30,0:05:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We will definitely stop you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.42,0:05:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,No one can stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.81,0:05:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,The original world could no longer sustain itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.01,0:05:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,The only reason you still exist is because of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.37,0:05:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It is the world I created that is keeping you alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.66,0:05:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m giving you one last chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.53,0:05:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Seize them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.77,0:05:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,,We won’t work for you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.17,0:05:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Ungrateful fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.09,0:05:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Green.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.64,0:05:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,No…don’t…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.20,0:05:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Pink…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.00,0:05:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Brown…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.98,0:05:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Peach…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.70,0:06:01.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Just be good now and become my energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.14,0:06:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,My dream…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.02,0:06:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,is counting on you to make it come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.63,0:06:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t disappear…I’ll lend you my body again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.34,0:06:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you…I’m so happy I met you…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.62,0:06:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.50,0:06:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,must stop Blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.95,0:06:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to stop Blue…please.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.70,0:06:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Pink! Peach! Green! Brown!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.06,0:06:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to be sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.30,0:06:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it’s your turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.02,0:06:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,In your current state, you’re no match for me at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.72,0:07:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you looking?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.92,0:08:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Weslie?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.42,0:08:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The sticker…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.17,0:08:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Without that gadget, what do you have left?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.41,0:08:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,The Energization Prevention Device is weakening.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.49,0:08:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.69,0:08:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry, he’ll definitely restore to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.14,0:08:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Slowy, is this machine really okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.58,0:08:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,No problem at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.54,0:08:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But…did you hear a strange sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.91,0:09:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You must have misheard.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.55,0:09:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Slowy, take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.55,0:09:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It brings back such nostalgic memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.39,0:09:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I, King Wolffy,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.88,0:09:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,have returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.76,0:09:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It—it worked!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.20,0:09:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s great! That’s great!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.96,0:09:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,King Wolffy is still just as handsome as ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.36,0:09:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Slowy, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.51,0:09:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are Wolnie and Wilie?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.73,0:09:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,They suddenly went out. They might be back any moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.93,0:09:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to head out to back up the little goats.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.88,0:09:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But you don’t have any gear right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.88,0:09:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Says who?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.33,0:09:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I figured Wolffy might need this gauntlet,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.29,0:09:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,so I’ve upgraded its capabilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.48,0:09:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That looks so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.76,0:09:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell Wolnie and Wilie to wait for me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.56,0:10:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That is…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.36,0:10:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,There’s light coming through the crack in the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.72,0:10:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe the Absorption Device is hidden in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.54,0:10:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, let’s go there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.07,0:10:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Have your devices finally run out of energy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.68,0:10:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Congratulations—you’re about to become part of my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.72,0:11:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.07,0:11:15.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay away!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.23,0:11:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.07,0:11:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, head toward that glowing house.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.08,0:11:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You are our last hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.23,0:11:42.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.67,0:11:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you can save the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.04,0:11:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t even think about escaping.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
